---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../../../lib/site';

const altPath = '/legal/privacidad/';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for KaizoGroup."
  includeLocalBusinessSchema={false}
  altPath={altPath}
>
  <Header altPath={altPath} />
  <main id="main-content" class="section-kz">
    <div class="container-kz max-w-2xl">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-display font-600 text-ink">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-body-soft">Last updated: September 7, 2026</p>

      <div class="mt-10 space-y-10 text-body">
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-600 text-ink">1. Data controller</h2>
          <ul class="mt-3 list-inside list-disc space-y-1 leading-relaxed">
            <li>Controller: {siteConfig.legal.titular}</li>
            <li>Tax ID (NIF): {siteConfig.legal.nif}</li>
            <li>Address: {siteConfig.legal.domicilio}, Spain</li>
            <li>Email: {siteConfig.contact.email}</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-600 text-ink">2. Purpose of processing</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
            Data submitted through this Site's contact form (name, email, business, and message) is
            processed in order to respond to inquiries or quote/audit requests sent by the user, and to
            maintain any business relationship that may arise from that contact. It is not used for any
            other purpose, and no automated decisions are made based on it.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-600 text-ink">3. Legal basis</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
            The legal basis for processing is the user's consent, given by voluntarily filling in and
            submitting the contact form (Art. 6.1.a GDPR), as well as, where applicable, the
            performance of pre-contractual measures requested by the data subject (Art. 6.1.b GDPR).
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-600 text-ink">4. Recipients and data processors</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
            The contact form is handled through <strong>Web3Forms</strong>, which acts as a data
            processor and forwards received messages directly to the email address listed above,
            without storing them for its own purposes. Data is not shared with third parties except
            where legally required.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
            This Site also uses <strong>Umami Analytics</strong> for aggregated, anonymous usage
            statistics (it does not use cookies or identify individual users), and{' '}
            <strong>Microsoft Clarity</strong> for anonymized heatmaps and session recordings that help
            us improve the Site's usability. Neither tool is used for advertising or commercial
            profiling.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-600 text-ink">5. Retention period</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
            Contact form data is kept only for as long as necessary to handle the inquiry and, if a
            business relationship begins, for as long as that relationship lasts plus any applicable
            legal retention periods.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-600 text-ink">6. Your rights</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
            You can exercise your rights of access, rectification, erasure, objection, restriction of
            processing, and data portability by writing to{' '}
            <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.contact.email}`} class="text-ink underline underline-offset-2">
              {siteConfig.contact.email}
            </a>
            , stating which right you wish to exercise and attaching a copy of an identity document.
            You also have the right to file a complaint with the Spanish Data Protection Agency
            (www.aepd.es) if you believe the processing does not comply with applicable law.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-600 text-ink">7. Source of the data</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
            The only personal data processed is what users voluntarily provide through the Site's
            contact form.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-600 text-ink">8. Cookies</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
            This Site does not use its own cookies. Microsoft Clarity, the behavioral analytics tool we
            use, may store a technical or session cookie to distinguish anonymous visits; Umami
            Analytics does not use cookies at all. Neither is used for advertising or cross-site
            tracking.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
